{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139790/extras/dd7981fca2b3eedf3bfd3bc6c843b3c9.avif?t=1762875876\" width=1280 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, slash and shoot in this top-down, multiplayer smash bros inspired fighting game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different abilities, combo and use your environment to your advantage. knock out your opponent, and use every arena and attack to it's maximum potential!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you fight players in a top down arena, trying to knock out other players. the last player standing is crowned winner! The more a player is hit, the higher their percent is, and larger the distance they will be knocked back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >move around the arena in 360\u00b0 and use different abilities in any direction. each ability has a base version, and a stronger but slower power version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can play in local or online play with up to 8 players!<br><br>the demo includes less abilities and arenas compared to the full game, but has the same modes and online connectivity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139790?t=1762875876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139790?t=1762875876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139790/031239d760f3e289e03cdf1db1a799d0bbcc5735/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762875876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139790/031239d760f3e289e03cdf1db1a799d0bbcc5735/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762875876","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player"